{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203310","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1320331001:1":{"text":"어라, 당신은 저번에 만났던 기이한 웨이터 아닌가요?","source_cn":"咦？你是我们之前见到的那位奇花侍者吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30E6BB8525294C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320331002:1":{"text":"아닐겁니다. 여러분이 최근 세레니티 장원을 자주 방문하셨지만, 저와는 대화를 나눈 적이 없으니까요.","source_cn":"我想应该不是。虽然诸位最近常来永寂庄园，但我从未与您搭过话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCB99E5C62A0A3FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320331003:1":{"text":"어쩐지 말투가 다르긴 하셨어요! 이전의 그분은 꽤 겁이 많았던 것 같거든요!","source_cn":"难怪你说话的语气不一样呢。之前那位侍者似乎很胆小！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DCB2031822BABBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320331004:0":{"text":"겁이 많은 기이한 웨이터... 아, 화구 정리 담당자를 말씀하시는 거군요.","source_cn":"胆小的奇花侍者……啊，想必是几日前凋零的那位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA5C23E714757E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320331005:0":{"text":"그는 요즘 피곤해하고 기분도 썩 좋지 않아요. 하지만 걱정 마세요. 아직 시들 때는 아니니까요.","source_cn":"他最近有些疲惫，情绪也有些低落。但请不必担心，他还没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDA4C00A38253FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320331006:0":{"text":"잠깐만요... 기이한 웨이터도 시드나요?!","source_cn":"等等……奇花侍者会凋零？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB17EBE26AF6CB743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320331007:0":{"text":"네. 자작님께서 저희에게 몸과 의식을 부여해 주셨지만 본질적으로 저희는 침묵의 꽃입니다. 수명이 늘어나긴 했어도 시드는 것은 모든 꽃의 운명이지요.","source_cn":"是的。虽然子爵先生用魔法赋予了我们身躯与意识，但本质上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF632AF59F671CDC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320331008:0":{"text":"...모두 자작님께 들은 거죠. 정말 열심히 기억해 두었답니다.","source_cn":"——这些话是子爵先生告诉我的，我很努力才记下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E339DE9FE3344DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320331009:0":{"text":"하지만, 이상하게도 자작님께서는 저희와 같은 침묵의 꽃이 부럽다고 하셨습니다. 언젠가 시들 날이 올 거라는 그 사실을요.","source_cn":"不过，不知道为什么，子爵先生竟然说他很羡慕我们这些永寂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A04DF256BDDF76A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320331010:0":{"text":"이 말씀은 아직도 이해가 되지 않아요. 자작님은 항상 생각이 깊으신 분이니...","source_cn":"这句话我到现在都没能理解。先生的想法总是很深奥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D2F47940B79FC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奇花侍者":{"text":"기이한 웨이터","source":"奇花侍者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}